Plateway community library: licence notice

Items (everything under pieces/, trains/ and furniture/)

Each item is licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International licence (CC BY 4.0),
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/, by its contributor. A train model adapted from another CC BY model keeps
that model's CC BY licence (2.0, 2.5, 3.0 or 4.0) and credits its authors; the item's metadata.json gives the licence
under "licence" and the source under "source".

Attribution: credit the contributor by the name in the item's pull request and in the Plateway library index (and,
for an adapted model, the source's authors), name the licence and link to it, and say if you changed the item.

Contributors confirmed, when uploading, that they have the right to share their item under its licence.

